// MW3 "Scorched Earth" hand-inspection / get-up viewmodel animation.
// Source: berlin_sgt_down_recovery_vm (441 frames @ 30fps), retargeted onto
// c_zom_der_dempsey_viewhands. GDT: source_data/_reapy/recovery.gdt
//
// Played through a weapon, the same way zm_test drives t6_deathanim: the
// weapon's raise/idle slots all point at the anim, so switching to it plays
// the clip on the viewhands. The weapon pulls its own dependencies
// (wpn_t7_none_view/world, vm_ap9_ads_base_*, hud_us_grenade) automatically.

scriptparsetree,scripts/zm/_recovery.gsc

weapon,berlin_recovery

xanim,berlin_sgt_down_recovery_vm
